note Readable homepage restored at Drake's request, 2026-11-06. Aien stays at /aien/.
note Readable site chrome. The homepage has navigation; the optional Aien scene has quiet controls.
note sc_begin stores metadata; sc_route emits head and opens main; sc_end finishes the document.
note Core sc_extrahead owns registry-aware JSONLD, hreflang, citations and route assets.
note Native root and Aien scripts come from Core. The consent dialog mirrors main's allen_intro.rs dialog().
