text scfoot0 "<footer class=\"aien-footer\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"footer-intro\"><a class=\"site-brand\" href=\"/classic/\">Sovereign Intelligence</a><p>Built on AienOS. Made by Drake Stapleton.</p><p class=\"aien-reach-foot\"><a href=\"https://x.com/mdrakestapleton\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">X @mdrakestapleton</a> <a href=\"mailto:drake@aienos.com\">drake@aienos.com</a> <a href=\"/aien/\">Speak to Aien</a> <a href=\"https://github.com/aien-dev\">GitHub</a></p></div>"
text scfoot1 "<div class=\"footer-links\"><a href=\"/turing/\">The Turing</a><a href=\"/experiments/\">Experiments</a><a href=\"/research/\">Research</a><a href=\"/evidence/\">Evidence</a><a href=\"/research/status/\">Research status</a><a href=\"/philosophy/\">Philosophy</a><a href=\"/post-llm-case/\">The Post-LLM Case</a><a href=\"/start/\">Start here</a><a href=\"/progress/\">Progress</a><a href=\"/blog/\">Blog</a><a href=\"/glossary/\">Glossary</a><a href=\"/contact/\">Contact</a><a href=\"/agents/\">Agent instructions</a><a href=\"https://interplane.io/\">Interplane</a><a href=\"https://www.drakestapleton.com\">Drake Stapleton</a></div><p class=\"aien-footer-machines\">For machines: <a href=\"/data/index.json\">data index</a> · <a href=\"/llms.txt\">llms.txt</a> · <a href=\"/llms-full.txt\">full text</a> · <a href=\"/sitemap.md\">sitemap.md</a> · <a href=\"/AGENTS.md\">AGENTS.md</a> · <a href=\"/feed.xml\">feed</a> · <a href=\"/now/feed.xml\">ledger feed</a></p><p class=\"footer-quiet\"><a href=\"/aien/#site-door\" data-site-replay data-site-mode=\"allen\">Replay the introduction</a> <a href=\"/aien/\" data-site-mode=\"allen\">Switch to Aien</a> <a href=\"/privacy/\">Privacy &amp; choices</a> <a href=\"/licensing/\">Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception</a></p><p class=\"muted\">Aien © 2026. No outside fonts. X tracking and Aien memory each need their own choice. Reading does not require either.</p></div></footer>"
text sccons "<dialog id=\"aien-allen-intro\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"allen-intro-title\" aria-describedby=\"allen-intro-intro allen-intro-consent\"><h2 id=\"allen-intro-title\">Say hello to Aien?</h2><p id=\"allen-intro-intro\">Hey, you just clicked an ad. I just want you to know that if you didn't intend to click an ad, that's cool. Just click No and this popup will close. Nothing will be tracked by my X pixel. Your browser may not let me close a page I didn't open.</p><p id=\"allen-intro-consent\">But if you did want to see it, do you mind if I track you and know you were here? Aien is my AI. Introduce yourself to Aien by saying hello below. Saying hello means you consent to the X conversion pixel, so X receives information about your visit and helps me reach the right people. This doesn't open a chat or publish your identity.</p><div class=\"allen-intro-actions\"><button id=\"allen-intro-no\" type=\"button\" autofocus>No</button><button id=\"allen-intro-yes\" type=\"button\">Introduce yourself to Aien</button></div><p id=\"allen-intro-memory\">Saying hello covers only the X pixel. Whether Aien remembers you is a separate choice that only the chat asks, and saying hello never makes it for you: <a href=\"/aien/?mode=remember\">Tell Aien my name</a> or <a href=\"/aien/?mode=anonymous\">chat with Aien anonymously</a>.</p><details id=\"allen-intro-who\" class=\"allen-intro-who\"><summary>Who can see me right now?</summary><p>This panel reads only this page and your browser. It sends nothing and stores nothing.</p><h3>Outside sites this page has loaded: <span id=\"allen-intro-tracker-count\">checking</span></h3><ul id=\"allen-intro-trackers\"></ul><p id=\"allen-intro-trackers-none\" hidden>None. Only this site's own files have loaded on this page.</p><h3>What your browser tells every website</h3><dl id=\"allen-intro-facts\"></dl><p>Any site you visit can read these. I don't keep them. Your IP address and browser name also reach this site's hosting providers with every request, as on any site.</p><h3>What this page can't see</h3><p>Trackers on other sites, in other tabs or inside embedded frames, tracking by your internet provider or network, and your browser extensions. These tools check more:</p><ul><li><a href=\"https://coveryourtracks.eff.org/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">EFF Cover Your Tracks</a></li><li><a href=\"https://themarkup.org/blacklight\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Markup's Blacklight</a></li></ul></details><p><a href=\"/privacy/\">Privacy, what X receives, and your choice</a></p></dialog>"
